  "description": "*“Bam! It was nothing short of a catastrophic entrance.”*\n\nA single car that suddenly barreled in was enough to turn Ju Han-Nan’s daily life upside down in an instant. What he found amidst the perilous accident was a man bound head to toe. The man he had saved on the spur of the moment.. Huh? Far from crying, he wore a carefree expression and acted suspiciously. \n\nThis guy... what is he? This man, who exuded a dangerous aura... You’re saying he’s dating my sister? And now he wants to live with us?! You’re lying!! \n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
